@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-61 - View Dashboard Overview

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Analytics UI" as FE
control "AnalyticsController" as API
control "AnalyticsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills, shoesDetail" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-61
FE -> API: GET /analytics/overview
API -> Service: Execute View Dashboard Overview
Service -> DB: Read/write bills, shoesDetail
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Dashboard hiển thị metrics tổng quan

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã đăng nhập với role admin/manager
Post: Dashboard hiển thị metrics tổng quan
Main flow:
1. Admin vào /admin/dashboard
2. System gọi API GET /analytics/overview
3. System trả về: totalRevenue, totalOrders, totalProducts, totalUsers,\nrecentOrders[], topProducts[]
4. Frontend hiển thị summary cards + charts
end note
@enduml
